Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Previously on Friends:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:03.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》前情介绍：
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Erica, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.87,0:00:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}艾瑞卡，你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, you know, maybe I ate too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还好，或许我吃太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I keep getting these stomachaches. They come and go, like, every few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一直有点胄痛，几分钟就痛一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, my God. -Relax, we'll just get her some antacids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天啊  -别担心，给她点胃药就好了
