Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:23.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你认为我没跟你单独道别
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because you don't mean as much to me as everybody else, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:27.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为你没有其他人重要  你就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's because you mean more to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.69,0:00:29.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是因为你太重要了
