Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  刚才你说得像吸血鬼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and it scared her.
