Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, it's pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  感觉太棒了
