Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们复合了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:26.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We didn't really get to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.62,0:05:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我俩还没仔细谈过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But do you want to get back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.29,0:05:30.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你自己想复合吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:31.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.09,0:05:31.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不清楚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:33.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:36.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, it just felt so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}感觉太对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I was holding her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:37.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我把她抱在怀里时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, I never wanted to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.95,0:05:40.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}永远都不想让她离开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:45.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Know what? Yeah, I do. I want to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:45.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  我想和她在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So is she still going to Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:50.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那她还去巴黎吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, I hadn't thought of that. I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还没想过  希望不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is, like, the best day ever. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:56.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天太伟大了  太伟大了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You guys might get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.55,0:05:58.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你俩要复合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:59.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica and Chandler get their baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:59.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡和钱德勒要有小孩
