Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-睡得怎样  -很好很好  你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Good. - I'll bet you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不错  -那还用说
