Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小鸡和小鸭  不是已经死...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:40.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dive. Yeah, they dove. Headfirst into fun on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:40.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死活非要去农场哦
