Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.33,0:06:54.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-早啊  -你也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Last night was just wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:56.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}昨晚太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:58.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:58.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的是
