Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-生命的奇迹啊   -好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow, that is one disgusting miracle.
