Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.53,0:08:21.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你成功了
