Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-咱们太幸运了  -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他眼睛和你的一样
