Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.59,0:09:05.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过真的是
