Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:48.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These are the faces of two people in the know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:48.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道我们俩还能这副表情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe you didn't know it's twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:57.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么可能不知道是双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:58.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This has never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.27,0:09:58.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前从来没有过的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:02.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, gosh. That makes me feel so special and good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.58,0:10:02.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这让我感觉又特殊又好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. Did you know it was twins?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  你知道是双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's here in the paperwork we got from the clinic in Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊  俄亥俄州送过来的文件里面写着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did anybody tell you? - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有人告诉过你吗   -没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They did mention two heartbeats,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过确实提到了两种心跳
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but l thought it was just mine and the baby's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我当时觉得应该就是我和孩子的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They said, "Both heartbeats are strong."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们就一直说两个心跳都很强
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I thought, "Well, that's good, because I'm having a baby."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就觉得不错啊 因为我正怀着孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:23.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太难以置信了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twins actually run in my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我家有生双胞胎的传统
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:26.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真有意思哈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I see you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你谈点事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:34.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:34.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在咋办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you mean, "What do we do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么咋办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:38.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}双胞胎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chandler, you're panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}钱德勒  你慌什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Join me, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  和我一起慌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you say we keep one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:46.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们留一个
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:49.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and then just have an option on the other one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:49.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一个给别人如何
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We can't split them up. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么可以分开啊  -为什么不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could give each of them half a medallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给他俩一人半块信物
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then years later, they'll find each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}数年之后他们凭着信物重逢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and be reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.39,0:11:01.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大团圆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, that's a great day for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.51,0:11:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}到那时候大家该多开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if the person who adopts the other one is horrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果领养另一个人的是坏蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if they're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:08.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if it's adopted by a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是被某国王领养了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Because I hear the king is looking to adopt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是哈  听说国王要领养个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Monica, we are not ready to have two babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:17.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  咱俩没想好要两个孩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have waited so long for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}咱们等了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care if it's two babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:22.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不管是一个孩子还是两个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care if it's three babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.77,0:11:24.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}仨孩子都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care if the entire cast of "Eight Is Enough" comes out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.30,0:11:28.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生出《八宝喜事》全剧组来都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:30.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are taking them home
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:30.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定要把他们带回家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because they are our children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他们是咱们的孩子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:38.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:38.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:43.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It looks like we're about ready over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:43.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看来我们这里准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:44.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, Erica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:44.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧  艾瑞卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Start pushing again now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始用力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Here she comes. - She? It's a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.26,0:11:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-女婴也出来了  -女婴  是个女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now we have one of each.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在一男一女了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后就别再生了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:07.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And then she said it was the perfect way to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:07.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来她说那是最好的告别方式
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:10.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:10.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  你说什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nothing. What do you say to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么都没说  能说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've got to tell her how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  一定要告诉她你的感受啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:18.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- No way. - Well, you can't just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:18.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不行  -不能就这么放弃她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:20.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that what a dinosaur would do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.03,0:12:20.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恐龙会这么做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dude. I'm just trying to speak your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是想用你们的语言和你表达
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:28.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, Rachel doesn't know that you even wanna get back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.87,0:12:28.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  瑞秋不知道你想复合
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If she did, she might feel differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果她知道 想法可能就会变啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She might not even go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:32.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许就不会走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- You really think so? - I'm telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.68,0:12:35.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你真的这么想   -没错的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, ok, this is the part of the musical
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.66,0:12:38.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的  如果是音乐剧的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:41.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}where there'd be a good, convincing song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.35,0:12:41.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在就应该是高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:51.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can't a girl finish a song around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.46,0:12:51.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}死活就不让我唱完了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey. - Hi. I dropped Emma off at my mom's.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿  -刚把艾玛交给我妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. - You're not taking her tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-哦  -你今晚不带艾玛走
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:13:01.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. We decided I'd set up, then my mom would bring Emma to Paris on Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:13:01.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不带了  我先去整理好 我妈星期天把艾玛带去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight-hour flight with a one year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}陪一岁小孩飞八个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:03.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:03.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你妈妈好运
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.99,0:13:04.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:06.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Eight hours with my mom talking about Atkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:06.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}陪我妈飞八个小时听她唠叨减肥食谱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是祝艾玛好运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:12.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. You know what? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:12.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I should at least tell her how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.12,0:13:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}至少要告诉她我的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Ross. Wait, wait. - What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-罗斯等一下  -什么  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could you get me a muffin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我带个松饼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Rachel? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:25.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-瑞秋  -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know you're leaving tonight,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你今晚就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:31.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I just have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.71,0:13:31.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就是想告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:34.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你
