Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.13,0:21:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开车送你去机场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:55.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Wish me luck. - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.40,0:21:55.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大伙祝我好运   -快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no seat belts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:09.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay. If we hit anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.74,0:22:11.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系  一旦车撞到什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the engine will explode,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:12.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马达就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:15.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}so it's better if you're thrown from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:15.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}相比之下还是被甩出去比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- All right, all right. Let's do this. - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.98,0:22:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好  我们走   -好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:22.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hey! - 80th and East End.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.47,0:22:22.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-喂  -东区80号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. I don't take passengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不载客
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The law makes you accept any fare.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}法律规定逢客必载的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:28.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't understand. This cab isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:28.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不明白  这车本来就不是计程车
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's your medallion number?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我去投诉你  你牌照号多少
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My medallion number is, get out of the cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}号码是  滚出车去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? - Get out of the cab!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么  -滚出车去  滚出车去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, hey, can I give you guys my housewarming gift now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  现在给你们乔迁礼怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:48.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Now, that you can do. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:48.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可以呀  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:23:01.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Chick Jr.? Duck Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:23:01.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小小鸡  小小鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:06.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't hide from Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.57,0:23:06.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别和妈妈捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can open your eyes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在可以睁开眼睛了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Are we off the bridge? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-下桥了吗   -下了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:21.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is the old woman on the bicycle still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:21.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}自行车上的老太太还活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:23.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, she jumped right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:23.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}活着  她及时跳开了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:26.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Phoebe, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  菲比  开慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:28.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you want to get to Rachel in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:28.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底想不想及时追上瑞秋
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:31.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but I don't want to die in your cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:31.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想  不过我不想死在你车里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You should have thought of that before you got in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}上车之前你怎么不想清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Tollbooth. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-收费站  -什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:38.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tollbooth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.91,0:23:38.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}收费站
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:42.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Four bucks. There are quarters in the glove compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.46,0:23:42.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}四块钱  杂物箱里有零钱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:45.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.36,0:23:45.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快点
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:52.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn, that window's clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.44,0:23:52.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈的  窗户怎么这么干净
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:07.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were wondering what was taking so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.79,0:24:07.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还说你拿礼物这么半天还不回来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:10.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but now we understand. You were doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:10.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在才知道你在干这个
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. I wanted to surprise you, but....
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.99,0:24:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我本想给你们个惊喜的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For your housewarming gift,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:17.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}作为乔迁礼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:20.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I got you a baby chick and a baby duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.65,0:24:20.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送给你们一只小鸡一只小鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You got us a chick and a duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.03,0:24:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的  给我们小鸡小鸭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.38,0:24:24.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.38,0:24:24.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just what you want for
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.67,0:24:25.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家里有婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.54,0:24:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}a new house with infants. Bird feces!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.54,0:24:28.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鸟粪真是锦上添花啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But they must've jumped off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:30.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定是从桌子上跳下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:31.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now they're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.91,0:24:31.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在都不见了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.85,0:24:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry, we'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.85,0:24:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别着急  慢慢找
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:35.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I'm gonna go check on the twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.08,0:24:35.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去看孩子去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.18,0:24:38.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God! What did I just step on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.18,0:24:38.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  我刚才踩着什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay. It's just an egg roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.77,0:24:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事了  就是个蛋卷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.42,0:24:44.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You stepped on my egg roll?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.42,0:24:44.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你竟敢踩我的蛋卷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:46.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.01,0:24:46.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:49.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't know to look for Chinese food on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.65,0:24:49.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会想到地上会有中国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:51.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just put it on a plate and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.15,0:24:51.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}放到盘子里  然后快走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.35,0:24:58.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Okay. Let's find these birds. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.35,0:24:58.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好了  开始找吧  -好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:04.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, wait. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.55,0:25:04.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等  听到了没
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.95,0:25:09.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're in the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.95,0:25:09.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在桌子里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.40,0:25:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.40,0:25:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.51,0:25:13.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- We gotta get them out of there! - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.51,0:25:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-必须要取出来  -怎么取
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.52,0:25:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can lure them out. You know any birdcalls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.52,0:25:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也许能引诱他们出来  你知道鸟怎么叫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, tons. I'm quite the woodsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.40,0:25:19.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然了  我就是干伐木工的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.45,0:25:23.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, maybe we can just tip the table a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.45,0:25:23.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把桌子一头抬起来点也许管用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, wait! The ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊等一下  球
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:44.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.76,0:25:44.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we can open this up somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.33,0:25:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不清楚  也许边上什么地方能打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.45,0:25:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.45,0:25:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.68,0:25:52.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. It's all glued together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.68,0:25:52.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行啊  都粘上了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:56.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does that mean we have to bust it open?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:56.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是说要生撬开
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:26:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I don't know. Maybe. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.26,0:26:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不知道也许吧  -天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.24,0:26:04.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. It's-- It's the foosball table.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.24,0:26:04.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我明白  这可是足球桌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:09.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, you know what? We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:09.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:11.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's like I would have said in that sci-fi movie
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:11.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就像我在一部科幻电影里面的台词一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.10,0:26:13.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}if I'd have gotten the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.10,0:26:13.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我当初赢到角色的话
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.59,0:26:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Those are our men in there, and we have to get them out...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.59,0:26:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"里面是我们的人  必须要救出来"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:22.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...even if I have to sacrifice the most important thing in my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:22.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"即使要牺牲我生命中最重要的东西...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:23.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my time machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:23.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的时间机器"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:28.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Did that movie ever get made? - It did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:28.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这电影拍出来了没   -根本也没拍
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:36.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  你去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To talk to Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:38.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}去找瑞秋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.03,0:26:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Isn't that why we took a ride in the death cab?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.03,0:26:40.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以我才坐死亡计程车来的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:42.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're walking up to her at the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:42.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就直接去登机口
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:45.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you never chased anyone through the airport before?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.93,0:26:45.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前在没在机场追过人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.47,0:26:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not since my cop show got canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.47,0:26:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的警察戏镜头被取消之后就没有过了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have to get a ticket to get past security.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}必须先买票才能通过安检
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:52.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? We're never gonna make it.
