Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:21.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, forget it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.07,0:32:21.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:23.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Newark is, like, an hour away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:23.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}纽瓦克  一个小时才能到
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no way we'll make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.50,0:32:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本赶不上
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's got her cell. You could call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她拿着手机呢  打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.20,0:32:29.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not doing this over the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.20,0:32:29.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不要在电话上谈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.17,0:32:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't have any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.17,0:32:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没其他办法了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.47,0:32:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Hello? - Rachel. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.47,0:32:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-喂  -瑞秋  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.60,0:32:42.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}By the way, did you just get on the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.60,0:32:42.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  你是不是刚上飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.73,0:32:44.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Yeah. - For what is worse, we would have caught her...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.73,0:32:44.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是啊 -不管怎样提一句   如果机场没去错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.95,0:32:46.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...if we were at the right airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.95,0:32:46.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们已经追上她了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:53.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Rachel, hang on. - <i>No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.10,0:32:53.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-瑞  等着  -不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:55.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Phoebe, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:55.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  你那边不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:33:02.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, no. No. You have to get off the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.76,0:33:02.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上  有点事情  你必须下飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.41,0:33:04.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- What? Why? - I have this feeling that...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.41,0:33:04.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-啊  为什么  -我有种感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.74,0:33:06.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...something's wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.74,0:33:06.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.09,0:33:10.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Something is wrong with the left phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.09,0:33:10.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}左"弗兰基"有毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, honey, I'm sure there's nothing wrong with the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.38,0:33:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  飞机肯定没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:16.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:16.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马上要起飞了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.53,0:33:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I love you, and l will call you the minute I get to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.53,0:33:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我爱你  一到巴黎就打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:24.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:24.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你刚才说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:26.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that was just my crazy friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.47,0:33:26.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}哦  我的疯朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She told me to get off the plane
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.78,0:33:28.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我下飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.31,0:33:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because she had a "feeling" that there...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.31,0:33:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为她就是感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.40,0:33:33.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...was something wrong with the left phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.40,0:33:33.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机左"弗兰基"有毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:37.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. That doesn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.83,0:33:37.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听起来可不妙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:38.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I wouldn't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.51,0:33:38.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.50,0:33:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She comes up with this stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.50,0:33:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and she's almost never right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.88,0:33:41.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且几乎从没对过
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.33,0:33:43.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she is sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.33,0:33:43.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是说她也有对的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:44.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well....
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.30,0:33:44.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:47.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:47.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要干吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't take this plane now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.38,0:33:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这飞机我不能坐
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.76,0:33:50.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, sir. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.76,0:33:50.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起先生  您去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.51,0:33:52.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to get off this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.51,0:33:52.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要下飞机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her friend has a feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.10,0:33:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她朋友感觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.51,0:33:57.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}something's wrong with the left phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.51,0:33:57.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机左"弗兰基"有毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.98,0:34:03.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Could I get some peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.98,0:34:03.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请给我拿点花生好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.98,0:34:04.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's wrong with the plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.98,0:34:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.92,0:34:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}飞机一点异常都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.25,0:34:08.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The left phalange.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.25,0:34:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}左"弗兰基"有毛病了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:10.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no "phalange."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.36,0:34:10.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根本就没有什么"弗兰基"
