Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.18,0:34:13.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天呐  这破飞机连"弗兰基"都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I'm not flying on it. - Ma'am. Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.38,0:34:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不飞了 -女士  请您坐好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:17.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:17.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}出什么事情了
