Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.45,0:34:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们都下去  飞机上根本就没有"弗兰基"
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.94,0:34:27.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is ridiculous. I--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.94,0:34:27.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太荒谬了吧  我...
