Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.63,0:34:31.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊随便吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.05,0:34:42.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. My job here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.05,0:34:42.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了  工作完成
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:46.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.88,0:34:46.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.77,0:34:50.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. You didn't even use the tools for most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.77,0:34:50.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大部分连工具都没用就弄下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, they were just slowing me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊  工具太碍事了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.78,0:34:56.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right. I gotta get back to the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.78,0:34:56.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好啦  我回去看孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.40,0:34:58.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See you girls later.
