Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Sorry about the table, man. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.12,0:35:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真抱歉阿  桌子这样了  -嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.99,0:35:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You gonna buy a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.99,0:35:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要买新的吗
