Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.40,0:35:12.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how much I'm gonna want to play
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.40,0:35:12.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你走后我估计
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.82,0:35:14.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}after you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.82,0:35:14.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不会怎么玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:20.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- At least we got these little guys out. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.76,0:35:20.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-至少这两个小家伙救出来了 -是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.94,0:35:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.94,0:35:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们还担心你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.13,0:35:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I better get used to things
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.13,0:35:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以后就多习惯有东西
