Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:31.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我手里拉屎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:43.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna miss these little guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.18,0:35:43.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会想你们的  小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.58,0:35:45.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was nice having birds around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.58,0:35:45.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再养养鸟还真挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.19,0:35:48.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.19,0:35:48.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe we should keep them here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.90,0:35:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它们就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.41,0:35:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.41,0:35:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. We got a lot going on right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯  我们现在也忙得要死
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:57.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And plus, here, they'd have their own room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:57.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且这里也有它们的房间啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.64,0:36:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could get a goose!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.64,0:36:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还可以再养只鹅
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, I think you're set with the poultry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得家禽类这两只就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.59,0:36:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks, man. You hear that, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.59,0:36:10.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多谢了  听到没有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're gonna get to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们要留在这里啦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.34,0:36:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it's good...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.34,0:36:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且这样也挺好的
