Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.09,0:36:19.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就有理由
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:20.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to come visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.01,0:36:20.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多回来看看了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.62,0:36:26.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think there may be another reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.62,0:36:26.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}其实还有另外一个理由
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.67,0:36:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So....
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.67,0:36:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么...
