Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.29,0:36:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尴尬的拥抱呢  还是假酷男握手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.67,0:36:45.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.67,0:36:45.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}啊  那好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.22,0:36:47.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}lame cool-guy handshake.
